In all my years of playing hack I think I must have come across one of
the funniest ways in which to die.

I was taking a little drink at a sink, and all of a sudden I hit a
potion of levitation, so I started to float. Not knowing what was going
to happen to me in the end I just stayed there and waited the time by so
that I could return to the ground. All of a sudden - Crash I fell.
`Crash' I hear you say, normally you float back down. I didn't.

205  rwhelan-A died on dungeon level XX.   -   Fell onto a sink

Great Way.


